---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
Prints declared unit ownership, placement and release selection as JSON. Does not build, provision, deploy or verify runtime capabilities

Usage: leptoskit infra graph [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --app-target <NAME>  Select a named target from the root leptoskit.toml
      --unit <UNIT>        Select a release unit, such as frontends.docs or services.play-api. Repeat to select several units. Omit to inspect the complete graph
  -h, --help               Print help
  -V, --version            Print version
